under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (SPDX: AGPL-3.0-only).

The full license text is intentionally NOT written here from memory. Before the repository is made public:

  1. Download the verbatim, unmodified text from the canonical source
       https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt
     (or copy it from the `LICENSE` file of an AGPL-3.0 package you have vetted), and replace the
     contents of this file with it, keeping the standard "How to Apply" notice only if counsel wants it.
  2. Have counsel confirm: AGPL-3.0-only vs AGPL-3.0-or-later, the copyright holder name, and the
     treatment of the upstream MIT code (see LICENSE-LocalMiniDrama, which must stay in the repo).
  3. `node scripts/open-source-export.mjs` fails until this file contains the full AGPL-3.0 text.

